:"Through comparison to a referenced population, both the TruAge and TruHealth reports give clearer context to biomarkers, enabling deeper understanding of where intervention may be needed."}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"diagnostic_links top"},"children":[{"tag":"a","hidden":false,"attributes":{"data-wf--global-cta-yellow--variant":"full-width-height","href":"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/work-with-us","class":"cta-yellow w-variant-5b9601e6-6a59-2b05-1b12-8de340a701eb w-inline-block"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"text-regular blue cta"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Join Our Provider Network"}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"cta-yellow-icon w-embed"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"\n"}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"cta-yellow-icon-v2 w-embed"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"\n"}]}]},{"tag":"a","hidden":false,"attributes":{"data-wf--global-cta-blue--variant":"full-width-height","href":"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/about-truage","class":"cta_blue w-variant-94260c0e-959b-bc05-fe6a-acd750cb1b17 w-inline-block"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"text-regular purple"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Read more about TruAge"}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"cta_blue-icon w-embed"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"\n"}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"id":"w-tabs-2-data-w-pane-1","attributes":{"data-w-tab":"Tab 2","class":"w-tab-pane","role":"tabpanel","aria-labelledby":"w-tabs-2-data-w-tab-1"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"report_tabs-panel-content"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"text-regular blue lh-130"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"TruAge identifies factors contributing to accelerated or decelerated aging and evaluates how different parts of your body age both independently and synchronously, creating actionable insights. The recommendations throughout the report can assist in informing your patient's lifestyle and targeted interventions, enabling you to optimize their health and potentially slow down the aging process."},{"tag":"br","hidden":false},{"tag":"br","hidden":false},{"tag":"#text","text":"In the TruHealth report, biomarkers identified as suboptimal have personalized lifestyle and supplement recommendations provided. prior epigenetic biomarker values can be compared against to offer insight into progress and areas that may need continued attention."}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"diagnostic_links top"},"children":[{"tag":"a","hidden":false,"attributes":{"data-wf--global-cta-yellow--variant":"full-width-height","href":"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/report-education#","class":"cta-yellow w-variant-5b9601e6-6a59-2b05-1b12-8de340a701eb w-inline-block"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"text-regular blue cta"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Apply as a Provider"}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"cta-yellow-icon w-embed"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"\n"}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"cta-yellow-icon-v2 w-embed"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"\n"}]}]},{"tag":"a","hidden":false,"attributes":{"data-wf--global-cta-blue--variant":"full-width-height","href":"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/report-education#","class":"cta_blue w-variant-94260c0e-959b-bc05-fe6a-acd750cb1b17 w-inline-block"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"text-regular purple"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Read more about TruAge"}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"cta_blue-icon w-embed"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"\n"}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"id":"w-tabs-2-data-w-pane-2","attributes":{"data-w-tab":"Tab 3","class":"w-tab-pane","role":"tabpanel","aria-labelledby":"w-tabs-2-data-w-tab-2"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"report_tabs-panel-content"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"text-regular blue lh-130"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Recommendations are a starting point, not a standalone prescription or treatment guide. Ensure your correlate these findings with the patient's current symptoms and standard blood chemistry before finalizing the protocol."}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"diagnostic_links top"},"children":[{"tag":"a","hidden":false,"attributes":{"data-wf--global-cta-yellow--variant":"full-width-height","href":"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/report-education#","class":"cta-yellow w-variant-5b9601e6-6a59-2b05-1b12-8de340a701eb w-inline-block"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"text-regular blue cta"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Apply as a Provider"}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"cta-yellow-icon w-embed"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"\n"}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"cta-yellow-icon-v2 w-embed"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"\n"}]}]},{"tag":"a","hidden":false,"attributes":{"data-wf--global-cta-blue--variant":"full-width-height","href":"https://www.trudiagnostic.com/report-education#","class":"cta_blue w-variant-94260c0e-959b-bc05-fe6a-acd750cb1b17 w-inline-block"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"text-regular purple"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Read more about TruAge"}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"cta_blue-icon w-embed"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"\n"}]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"report-item big swiper-slide","role":"group","aria-label":"4 / 5","style":"width: 1889px;"},"children":[{"tag":"div","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"report-item-title-wrap"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","hidden":false,"attributes":{"class":"report-item-title"},"children":[{"tag":"#text","text":"Technical Methodology & Rigor"}]}]},{"ta